---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Contact USIVA | Start with a Clear Question';
const description = 'Prepare a concise visa and immigration planning question, choose the right pathway, and use a verified official channel for sensitive records.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/contacts.html';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  activePath="/contacts.html"
  canonical={canonical}
  topbarMessage="A clear question is the safest first handoff."
  topbarLink={{ label: 'Read the tips and FAQ', href: '/tips-faq.html' }}
>
  <section class="contact-intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="shell-container contact-intro__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contacts / start here</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Start with a concise question brief.</h1>
        <p class="contact-intro__lede">Use this page to prepare a careful handoff: choose a route, write the stage, purpose, date, and unclear item, then continue to the verified official channel when sensitive records are required.</p>
        <nav class="intro-actions" aria-label="Contact page next steps">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="#routes">Choose a route</a>
          <a class="button button--outline" href="/briefs.html">Read a question brief</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <aside class="privacy-note" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy boundary</p>
        <h2 id="privacy-heading">Submit sensitive information only through the verified official channel.</h2>
        <p>Keep the first question short. Share personal records only through a verified, appropriate channel requested by the responsible provider or authority.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section route-section" id="routes" aria-labelledby="route-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Choose the destination</p>
        <h2 id="route-heading">The right next action depends on what you are trying to do.</h2>
        <p>USIVA can help you organize the question. The links below point to the public route or planning page that matches the decision.</p>
      </header>

      <ul class="route-list">
        <li><a href="/visa.html"><span>01</span><strong>Orient a visa question</strong><small>Start with the directory before narrowing to a category or authority.</small><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/visa-categories.html"><span>02</span><strong>Compare visa categories</strong><small>Review temporary, study, work, family, and permanent-route groupings.</small><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/employers.html"><span>03</span><strong>Discuss an employer-side question</strong><small>Use the employer route for I-9, E-Verify, records, and handoff orientation.</small><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/official-tools.html"><span>04</span><strong>Verify a government task</strong><small>Use official case-status, visa, and employer resources directly.</small><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacts.html#brief-heading"><span>05</span><strong>Prepare a concise handoff</strong><small>Use the question brief below and leave out identifying numbers until the recipient gives you a verified channel.</small><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--mist" id="brief-heading" aria-labelledby="brief-title">
    <div class="shell-container brief-grid">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">The question brief</p>
        <h2 id="brief-title">Four lines are enough to make a handoff useful.</h2>
        <p>Write these down before you open a message, meeting, or application portal. Leave out identifying numbers until the recipient gives you a verified way to share them.</p>
      </header>
      <dl class="brief-list">
        <div><dt>Current stage</dt><dd>Exploring, preparing, admitted, studying, researching, or planning a next step.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Purpose</dt><dd>Study, research, training, travel, assistantship, internship, or employment question.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Decision date</dt><dd>The deadline, start date, interview, travel date, or authorization window that matters.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Unclear item</dt><dd>The instruction, document, activity, or promise you need the responsible authority to verify.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section no-form" aria-labelledby="no-form-heading">
    <div class="shell-container no-form__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">A deliberate limit</p>
        <h2 id="no-form-heading">This page starts with a planning brief.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="no-form__copy flow">
        <p>The public route provides route guidance and a question brief. Write the stage, purpose, date, and unclear item here; keep names, passport details, addresses, and documents within the verified recipient’s approved system.</p>
        <p>When a person or provider requests sensitive information, verify the destination independently and confirm why it is needed before sharing it. For individualized immigration advice, consult a licensed attorney in the relevant jurisdiction.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/pricing.html">Review scope questions before paying <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section contact-next" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Make the next move</p>
        <h2 id="next-heading">Take the smallest action that gets you closer to a verified answer.</h2>
        <p>Continue to the official tools directory, the employer route, or a short research brief before sharing any personal information.</p>
      </header>
      <ul class="next-links">
        <li><a href="/official-tools.html"><strong>Open official tools</strong><span>Use direct government and program resources.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/employers.html"><strong>Review employer resources</strong><span>Separate employer workflow from personal legal advice.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/briefs.html"><strong>Read research briefs</strong><span>Start with a source-led planning question.</span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="source-note">For current instructions, start with <a href="https://www.uscis.gov/" rel="noreferrer">USCIS</a>, the <a href="https://travel.state.gov/content/travel/en/us-visas.html" rel="noreferrer">Department of State</a>, or the school, sponsor, employer, or attorney responsible for the matter.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-intro {
    background: var(--color-mist);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .contact-intro__grid {
    align-items: end;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.9fr);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .contact-intro h1 {
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .contact-intro__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2);
    max-width: 57ch;
  }

  .intro-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .privacy-note {
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding: var(--space-3);
  }

  .privacy-note h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .privacy-note p:last-child {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-heading,
  .contact-next > div > header {
    max-width: 58rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .brief-grid h2,
  .no-form h2,
  .contact-next h2 {
    max-width: 25ch;
  }

  .route-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .route-list li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .route-list a {
    align-items: start;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: 2.2rem minmax(12rem, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1fr) 1.3rem;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-1);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .route-list a:hover {
    background: var(--color-mist);
  }

  .route-list span,
  .route-list b {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .route-list strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .route-list small {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .brief-grid,
  .no-form__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
  }

  .brief-grid > header,
  .no-form__grid > div:first-child {
    max-width: 31rem;
  }

  .brief-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .brief-list > div {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(9rem, 0.45fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
  }

  .brief-list dt {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .brief-list dd {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .no-form {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .no-form h2 {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .no-form__copy p {
    color: var(--color-on-dark-muted);
  }

  .no-form .text-link {
    color: var(--color-paper);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .next-links {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .next-links li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .next-links a {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .next-links strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .next-links span,
  .source-note {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .source-note {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .source-note a {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .contact-intro__grid,
    .brief-grid,
    .no-form__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .privacy-note {
      max-width: 38rem;
    }

    .route-list a {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(12rem, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1fr) 1.2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .intro-actions .button {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .route-list a,
    .brief-list > div,
    .next-links a {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .route-list small,
    .route-list b {
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .route-list b {
      grid-row: 1;
      grid-column: 2;
      justify-self: end;
    }

    .brief-list dd,
    .next-links span {
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .brief-list dt {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
